-*   `Ray`: struct containing `origin` (vec3), `direction` (vec3), `t_max` (float).
-*   `Medium`: struct containing `sigma_t` (float), `sigma_s` (float), `sigma_a` (float).
-*   `Intersection`: struct containing `point` (vec3), `distance` (float), `is_surface` (bool).
